{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1329"},"reason":"The candle-flame paragraph called the microgravity flame simply a sphere. NASA's experiment reports (Shuttle USML-1 1992, Mir 1996) describe it as small, dim blue and hemispherical, because the wick and candle block its lower part. The body now says so after the sphere sentence. The answer \"sphere\" stays, since NASA's own caption calls the flame spherical.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20010074076"},{"url":"https://www.nasa.gov/image-article/candle-flame-1g-vs-microgravity/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",290],["+","The researchers' own reports describe it more precisely as hemispherical, since the wick and the candle below it block its lower part. "],["=",969]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",272],["+","Die Forschungsberichte selbst nennen sie genauer halbkugelförmig, weil Docht und Kerze ihren unteren Teil abschirmen. "],["=",959]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",232],["+","В отчётах самих исследователей оно точнее названо полусферическим: нижнюю часть заслоняют фитиль и свеча. "],["=",889]]}],"actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"bc02606c81ebbaa22c7ae5c48ac67ff098a2d833e947dcfccfce5dd7a9d31511"},
{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1329"},"reason":"Notes now accept \"hemisphere\" as an answer, because the primary research reports describe the flame as hemispherical.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20010074076"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","old":"The card's answer is worded „kugelförmig“ (spherical): without convection the flame becomes a small blue sphere.","new":"The card's answer is worded „kugelförmig“ (spherical): without convection the flame becomes a small blue sphere. „Hemisphere“ is also accepted."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"Die Karte formuliert die Antwort als „kugelförmig“: Ohne Konvektion wird die Flamme zu einer kleinen blauen Kugel.","new":"Die Karte formuliert die Antwort als „kugelförmig“: Ohne Konvektion wird die Flamme zu einer kleinen blauen Kugel. „Halbkugel“ ist ebenfalls richtig."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"На карточке ответ сформулирован как «шарообразная»: без конвекции пламя становится маленьким голубым шаром.","new":"На карточке ответ сформулирован как «шарообразная»: без конвекции пламя становится маленьким голубым шаром. Принимается также ответ «полусфера»."}],"hash":"b1ff05f4cd4e","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"9268a4a69259bec04a238dc70e3ce2aa80f9ceed933f84d8628b1017b9115671"},
